WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.781
In verse 16.8,

2
00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:35.869
Lord Krishna explains that people
of demoniac nature

3
00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:41.499
accept neither any moral direction
nor the authority of scripture.

4
00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:48.882
Now He reveals the core ideology
that gives rise to such conduct.

5
00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:55.013
While the previous verse focused on
their behaviour, in this verse Lord Krishna

6
00:00:55.013 --> 00:01:00.268
presents the philosophy that
justifies that behaviour.

7
00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:08.026
Some ideas sound philosophical, but

8
00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:13.948
when they are put into practice
they prove extremely dangerous.

9
00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:17.118
Such as believing that this world is unreal,

10
00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:22.457
has no foundation, and that God
has no existence within it.

11
00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:27.420
Lord Krishna describes four core
beliefs of the demoniac nature.

12
00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.089
Asatya,

13
00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:32.675
meaning the world is unreal.

14
00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:35.095
Apratishtha, meaning

15
00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:38.473
it has no permanent foundation.

16
00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:43.520
Anishvara, meaning it has no controller.

17
00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.146
Kama-haitukam,

18
00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:50.026
meaning all this is born only of lust.

19
00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:55.281
Consider someone saying, life
has no meaning, there is no God.

20
00:01:55.281 --> 00:02:00.745
We are merely a biological accident,
and to enjoy as much as possible is life.

21
00:02:00.745 --> 00:02:02.914
This view is not new.

22
00:02:02.914 --> 00:02:06.209
Sometimes it comes as materialism,

23
00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:11.840
sometimes as rebellious atheism, and
sometimes in certain extreme ideas of Advaita,

24
00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:15.760
where the world is called mere illusion.

25
00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.763
But they share one common thread,

26
00:02:18.763 --> 00:02:22.851
denial, denial of a higher purpose,
denial of a higher

27
00:02:22.851 --> 00:02:29.107
law, denial of a higher controller,
and its consequence.

28
00:02:29.107 --> 00:02:32.318
If there is no God, then there is no karma.

29
00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:35.530
If there is no soul, then there is
no consequence either.

30
00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:41.244
If life is only an accident, then morality
becomes merely a matter of convenience.

31
00:02:41.244 --> 00:02:46.666
Then people begin to justify lies,
deceit, and exploitation.

32
00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:50.837
They say, after all, nothing really matters.

33
00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:55.842
This is where the gates of immorality
open completely.

34
00:02:55.842 --> 00:03:00.346
The irony is that those who call the world unreal

35
00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:04.601
are the very ones who crave to enjoy it the most.

36
00:03:04.601 --> 00:03:08.271
They deny the soul, deny the creator,

37
00:03:08.271 --> 00:03:12.442
and reduce life to only the desires of the body.

38
00:03:12.442 --> 00:03:17.697
Their song becomes, enjoy as long as it lasts.

39
00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:21.618
But the philosophy they call great is often

40
00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:26.497
only a means to justify the thirst for enjoyment.

41
00:03:26.497 --> 00:03:30.126
Hidden at the root of their denial is fear.

42
00:03:30.126 --> 00:03:34.339
Fear of responsibility and fear of restraint.

43
00:03:34.339 --> 00:03:35.465
Kama-haitukam,

44
00:03:35.465 --> 00:03:38.426
meaning creation is made only of lust.

45
00:03:38.426 --> 00:03:42.096
This shows the narrowness of their vision.

46
00:03:42.096 --> 00:03:48.061
When everything is seen through
the lens of desire, purity is destroyed.

47
00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:51.314
Relationships, family, society,

48
00:03:51.314 --> 00:03:54.317
all become means of personal pleasure.

49
00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:57.445
And the result is that relationships break,

50
00:03:57.445 --> 00:04:03.409
values weaken, and people, despite
being more connected than ever,

51
00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:07.413
become more lonely within.

52
00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:10.667
Lord Krishna does not merely refute these ideas,

53
00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:13.670
He also reveals their consequences.

54
00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:16.714
This verse is a warning for us too.

55
00:04:16.714 --> 00:04:21.010
What subtle ideas are we taking in from society?

56
00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:24.013
Are we regarding the world as sacred?

57
00:04:24.013 --> 00:04:27.225
Are we seeing life as a divine plan

58
00:04:27.225 --> 00:04:30.103
or treating it as mere accident?

59
00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:33.690
Are we remembering that life has a purpose,

60
00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:39.779
there is a controller, and beyond the
desires of the body there is also a deeper truth.

61
00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:46.911
When someone says,

62
00:04:46.911 --> 00:04:50.623
there is no God, no higher truth,

63
00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:53.626
no purpose,

64
00:04:53.626 --> 00:04:58.464
it may sound like courage,

65
00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:02.677
but in reality it is extremely dangerous.

66
00:05:02.677 --> 00:05:07.098
Such people believe that this world is unreal,

67
00:05:07.098 --> 00:05:11.769
without foundation and without a controller.

68
00:05:11.769 --> 00:05:13.938
But

69
00:05:13.938 --> 00:05:19.569
denying a law does not make it cease to exist.

70
00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.904
If someone says

71
00:05:21.904 --> 00:05:24.741
that there is no gravity

72
00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:28.703
and then jumps from a height,

73
00:05:28.703 --> 00:05:33.499
will gravity spare them?

74
00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:35.918
No.

75
00:05:35.918 --> 00:05:38.129
In the same way,

76
00:05:38.129 --> 00:05:40.715
when people deny Me,

77
00:05:40.715 --> 00:05:44.552
the supreme controller,

78
00:05:44.552 --> 00:05:47.847
it does not erase responsibility,

79
00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:53.186
it only closes their eyes to the consequences.

80
00:05:53.186 --> 00:05:57.190
This view becomes an excuse.

81
00:05:57.190 --> 00:06:01.486
If nothing matters,

82
00:06:01.486 --> 00:06:07.116
then why not deceive, why not exploit?

83
00:06:07.116 --> 00:06:10.912
Why not live only in enjoyment?

84
00:06:10.912 --> 00:06:14.290
But soon

85
00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:18.461
that enjoyment turns into addiction.

86
00:06:18.461 --> 00:06:21.714
Relationships become meaningless,

87
00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:26.469
and the soul feels empty within.

88
00:06:26.469 --> 00:06:28.262
Because

89
00:06:28.262 --> 00:06:33.768
without Me, nothing remains sacred.

90
00:06:33.768 --> 00:06:39.065
You are not made only to consume,

91
00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:42.360
you are made to connect.

92
00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.696
When you remember

93
00:06:45.696 --> 00:06:48.282
that I am here,

94
00:06:48.282 --> 00:06:50.118
watching,

95
00:06:50.118 --> 00:06:52.787
guiding,

96
00:06:52.787 --> 00:06:55.456
caring for you,

97
00:06:55.456 --> 00:06:59.460
then you live with more care, more dignity,

98
00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:03.840
and more peace.

99
00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:07.260
You are not an accident.

100
00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:12.098
You are part of a divine plan,

101
00:07:12.098 --> 00:07:17.311
and when you live with this awareness,

102
00:07:17.311 --> 00:07:20.106
your life once again

103
00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:22.483
becomes whole.

104
00:07:26.988 --> 00:07:30.867
When relationships are based only
on physical attraction

105
00:07:30.867 --> 00:07:34.454
or personal pleasure,

106
00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:38.291
they give excitement at first

107
00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:41.878
but no peace in the end.

108
00:07:41.878 --> 00:07:44.839
People of demoniac nature believe

109
00:07:44.839 --> 00:07:47.925
that the world has no purpose

110
00:07:47.925 --> 00:07:52.722
and that everything is born of lust.

111
00:07:52.722 --> 00:07:58.269
And when this thinking enters the family,

112
00:07:58.269 --> 00:08:01.314
hearts become empty

113
00:08:01.314 --> 00:08:04.400
and homes become unstable.

114
00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:10.031
If marriage is regarded only as
a contract of enjoyment

115
00:08:10.031 --> 00:08:14.535
and not understood as a sacred
bond of upliftment,

116
00:08:14.535 --> 00:08:17.830
it loses its meaning.

117
00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.958
When love becomes selfish,

118
00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:25.796
people feel used.

119
00:08:25.796 --> 00:08:30.927
When commitment is replaced by convenience,

120
00:08:30.927 --> 00:08:33.638
trust begins to break.

121
00:08:33.638 --> 00:08:37.683
Gradually, the home, no longer a safe shelter,

122
00:08:37.683 --> 00:08:41.229
becomes a hollow space.

123
00:08:41.229 --> 00:08:46.317
I have created the family as a sacred place,

124
00:08:46.317 --> 00:08:51.531
for service, sacrifice, and spiritual progress,

125
00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:57.828
not to bind you, but to nurture you.

126
00:08:57.828 --> 00:08:58.996
When you

127
00:08:58.996 --> 00:09:03.626
see your spouse not as a means of pleasure

128
00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:07.296
but as a soul,

129
00:09:07.296 --> 00:09:10.466
your love deepens.

130
00:09:10.466 --> 00:09:13.678
Your home becomes gentle,

131
00:09:13.678 --> 00:09:18.266
your heart becomes strong.

132
00:09:18.266 --> 00:09:21.269
Build your relationships on respect,

133
00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:25.314
purpose, and shared values,

134
00:09:25.314 --> 00:09:28.859
only then will peace and contentment

135
00:09:28.859 --> 00:09:31.487
flow through your home.

136
00:09:35.992 --> 00:09:38.536
At today's workplace,

137
00:09:38.536 --> 00:09:42.999
it has become very easy to justify selfishness.

138
00:09:42.999 --> 00:09:46.252
People say, this is just business.

139
00:09:46.252 --> 00:09:48.337
Everyone does this here.

140
00:09:48.337 --> 00:09:53.009
But I have warned

141
00:09:53.009 --> 00:09:56.095
that the demoniac view begins right there,

142
00:09:56.095 --> 00:09:59.056
where people believe

143
00:09:59.056 --> 00:10:01.309
that the world has no foundation,

144
00:10:01.309 --> 00:10:04.604
no controller, no purpose,

145
00:10:04.604 --> 00:10:08.232
and that everything is born only of desire.

146
00:10:08.232 --> 00:10:10.234
When profit

147
00:10:10.234 --> 00:10:13.404
becomes the only goal,

148
00:10:13.404 --> 00:10:16.574
and breaking rules with clever

149
00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:20.328
arguments, disrespecting people,
or justifying the race for only short-term

150
00:10:20.328 --> 00:10:25.374
gain is upheld, the organisation

151
00:10:25.374 --> 00:10:28.252
begins to rot from within,

152
00:10:28.252 --> 00:10:32.006
trust dies, teams fall apart,

153
00:10:32.006 --> 00:10:36.260
and work becomes hollow.

154
00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:39.347
Even if targets are being met.

155
00:10:39.347 --> 00:10:43.225
What makes work sacred is not only

156
00:10:43.225 --> 00:10:46.729
what you are doing, but also

157
00:10:46.729 --> 00:10:49.982
how and why you are doing it.

158
00:10:49.982 --> 00:10:54.820
When respect, justice, and
integrity are removed,

159
00:10:54.820 --> 00:11:01.202
even the most magnificent plans feel hollow.

160
00:11:01.202 --> 00:11:04.914
Do not let cleverness take the place

161
00:11:04.914 --> 00:11:07.917
of the voice of your conscience.

162
00:11:07.917 --> 00:11:10.044
Do not let ambition

163
00:11:10.044 --> 00:11:13.881
crush harmony.

164
00:11:13.881 --> 00:11:18.719
The workplace that is driven by purpose,

165
00:11:18.719 --> 00:11:21.597
that alone flourishes.

166
00:11:21.597 --> 00:11:25.518
But the one run only by boundless desires

167
00:11:25.518 --> 00:11:29.397
ultimately falls apart.
